@format 1
@id import.losslesscut-import
@title Import LosslessCut project
@area Import
@entry input
@summary Validate a LosslessCut project against active media, let the user choose replace or append, and commit imported sections.
@flow TB
@related import.losslesscut-detection, shared.synchronize-sections
@tag losslesscut
@tag import

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias lossless = Cadroue.Media.LLosslesscut

[input] LosslessCut import request <input>
- Receive an explicit or detected project path @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutImport(...)
> read

[read] Read project <decision>
- Read and parse the LosslessCut project @ lossless.LLosslesscutRead(...)
? "Project is readable" > version
? "Project cannot be read" > failed

[version] Check project version <decision>
- Check whether the declared version is supported @ lossless.LLosslesscutVersionCheck(...)
? "Version is supported or user continues" > media
? "User rejects the version warning" > cancelled

[media] Validate media and segments <decision>
- Validate the declared media name and segment ranges against the active media @ lossless.LLosslesscutValidate(...)
? "Media matches or user accepts mismatch" > content
? "User rejects the media mismatch" > cancelled

[content] Check usable segments <decision>
? "At least one valid segment remains" > mode
? "No valid segment remains" > empty

[mode] Choose import mode <decision>
- Present validation results and request Replace, Append, or Cancel @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutImport(...)
? "Replace" > apply
? "Append" > apply
? "Cancel" > cancelled

[apply] Commit imported sections <process>
- Convert valid records to palette-colored timeline segments @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutCreate(...)
- Replace or append sections and select the first imported segment @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutImport(...)
> fragment:shared.synchronize-sections

[failed] Read failed <error>
- Record and present the project read failure @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutImport(...)
= Existing sections are unchanged.

[empty] No usable segments <error>
- Present the validation summary @ flow.PFlowLosslesscutImport(...)
= Existing sections are unchanged.

[cancelled] Import cancelled <output>
= Existing sections are unchanged.
